The ST77922 initialisation sequence in esphome/st77922-init-sequence.yaml is a
register table for a third-party controller, published by LCDwiki in their own
Arduino examples (https://github.com/ydedox/st77922) and independently present
in this board's shipped firmware. It is reproduced here as interoperability
data. No claim of copyright is made over it, and no LCDwiki or Sitronix code,
compiled firmware, or documentation is redistributed by this repository.
